# Place a real rigged ISL avatar GLB/GLTF here as:
#   missingwhisper-avatar.glb
#
# The AvatarLoader (apps/web/src/lib/avatar) probes this exact URL at
# /assets/avatars/missingwhisper-avatar.glb. If the file is absent, the app
# gracefully falls back to the labelled procedural placeholder. If present, it
# must expose the named bones defined in AVATAR_BONES (apps/web/src/lib/avatar/
# constants.ts): root, torso, head, left_upper_arm, left_forearm, left_hand,
# right_upper_arm, right_forearm, right_hand — otherwise the loader reports a
# bone-validation error rather than animating a broken rig.
#
# This folder intentionally contains no avatar binary in Phase 2D.
